Ryan couldn't say.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:59.262
- Where's the Frosted Flakes?
- That's four.

00:06:59.471 --> 00:07:01.639
"I love you."

00:07:01.847 --> 00:07:04.182
Shut up.
Ryan, Marissa said that to you?

00:07:05.891 --> 00:07:08.727
- Okay, what did you say?
- "Thank you."

00:07:11.145 --> 00:07:13.646
Well, guess we'll be
staying in tonight.

00:07:13.855 --> 00:07:15.898
Carson Daly and a ball dropping.

00:07:16.398 --> 00:07:20.609
There's two images that should
never be said in the same sentence.

00:07:28.572 --> 00:07:31.407
Nice of the doctors to keep
the offices open today...

00:07:31.574 --> 00:07:34.659
