before they're broken.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:36.536
Yeah, it was nice of them.

00:07:36.702 --> 00:07:39.454
So, what are they?

00:07:39.663 --> 00:07:42.498
Your resolutions
that you're never gonna keep.

00:07:42.706 --> 00:07:43.874
Give me one. At least one.

00:07:44.082 --> 00:07:45.791
I'm gonna eat more vegetables.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:49.169
Wow. You and the doc
really went deep.

00:07:49.377 --> 00:07:53.630
- What about dairy? Grains?
- Actually, we feel good about the grains.

00:07:53.838 --> 00:07:56.590
And tonight, New Year's Eve,
you're a social chair.

00:07:56.798 --> 00:07:58.716
