00:08:06.346 --> 00:08:07.472
One of us has to.

00:08:08.639 --> 00:08:09.806
What are you doing?

00:08:10.015 --> 00:08:12.016
Well, now that you've asked...

00:08:12.225 --> 00:08:14.559
