00:08:17.811 --> 00:08:19.396
You live in the Four Seasons?

00:08:20.105 --> 00:08:22.106
Come by and I'll explain everything.

00:08:22.981 --> 00:08:24.149
Yeah, maybe we will.

00:08:24.357 --> 00:08:27.317
