A little Ann Taylor, little Ralph Lauren.

00:09:01.214 --> 00:09:03.840
Oh, my God. Is this from Talbots?

00:09:04.049 --> 00:09:07.301
It was a gift. Haven't you been living
in hostels, out of a backpack...

00:09:07.509 --> 00:09:09.719
...wearing hemp clothes?
- That was last year, Kiki.

00:09:09.927 --> 00:09:14.388
Don't call me Kiki. Only Dad calls me Kiki.
And only because he won't not.

00:09:14.805 --> 00:09:18.349
- You do remember Dad, don't you?
- I have a vague recollection.

00:09:18.558 --> 00:09:20.476
Well, wait till he hears you're back.

00:09:20.684 --> 00:09:22.560
You know,
I was gonna tell him in due time.

00:09:22.769 --> 00:09:25.771
You have two weeks
before he gets back from Paris...

00:09:25.979 --> 00:09:27.230
