00:09:27.438 --> 00:09:29.023
Dad and Julie Cooper?

00:09:29.606 --> 00:09:31.858
At least he's dating somebody my age,
not yours.

00:09:32.066 --> 00:09:33.942
How does Jimmy Cooper feel about this?

00:09:34.151 --> 00:09:35.819
Pretty good...

00:09:36.027 --> 00:09:38.987
