- Yeah, I was just gonna ask you.

00:09:52.954 --> 00:09:54.622
Kitchen. So tonight?

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:57.124
Yeah, what time should I make
the reservations?

00:09:57.332 --> 00:09:58.333
- Eight?
- Eight.

00:09:58.541 --> 00:10:00.834
