00:10:18.845 --> 00:10:21.055
Forget it.
Anyway, so tonight you guys...

00:10:21.264 --> 00:10:23.765
Are going to dinner at the Arches.
We do it every year.

00:10:23.932 --> 00:10:26.350
Home in time to watch Dick Clark
and the ball drop.

00:10:26.559 --> 00:10:28.893
Two images that shouldn't be used
in the same sentence.

00:10:29.102 --> 00:10:32.270
It's too bad you're busy tonight.
I know this really great party...

00:10:32.479 --> 00:10:34.689
...where you guys would have,
like, actual fun.

00:10:34.897 --> 00:10:37.440
