- Who's Oliver?

00:11:01.664 --> 00:11:04.040
A guy from therapy.

00:11:04.249 --> 00:11:07.417
Hey, there'll be crudit Ás. And dip.

00:11:07.918 --> 00:11:10.127
Sorry. I guess it's more
