00:11:20.092 --> 00:11:25.179
- Yeah, well, that was before...
- Right. Before I...

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:31.057
- What?
- Because I didn't say...

00:11:32.225 --> 00:11:35.143
- What?
- When you said...

00:11:35.643 --> 00:11:38.562
- What?
- Never mind.

00:11:41.022 --> 00:11:42.731
