Like we agreed.

00:11:45.358 --> 00:11:48.568
- Okay. Well, if you change your mind...
- So you're going?

00:11:48.943 --> 00:11:51.111
Like I said. Yep.

00:11:51.779 --> 00:11:53.530
Happy New Year.

00:11:55.698 --> 00:11:57.741
Happy New Year.

00:12:01.493 --> 00:12:03.244
You know what you did?

00:12:04.495 --> 00:12:06.913
You know what you did?
You blew it, buddy.

00:12:07.121 --> 00:12:09.540
