- "Thank you."

00:12:44.103 --> 00:12:46.313
- Thank you.
- Well, that was polite.

00:12:46.521 --> 00:12:48.689
That's what I said.

00:12:50.732 --> 00:12:52.191
- You guys have fun.
- See you.

00:12:52.358 --> 00:12:54.609
- I love you guys.
- Thank you.

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:00.029
