when she sees this guy Oliver.

00:14:11.241 --> 00:14:14.326
Seven, six, five.

00:14:14.534 --> 00:14:17.203
Fireworks start, music swells.

00:14:17.411 --> 00:14:19.287
Four, three.

00:14:19.496 --> 00:14:22.498
People are pairing off.
Who's she gonna kiss?

00:14:23.165 --> 00:14:25.750
Two, one.

00:14:25.958 --> 00:14:27.543
- You guys look hot.
- Too hot?

00:14:27.751 --> 00:14:30.211
Because I'm trying to keep
a low profile these days.

00:14:30.419 --> 00:14:33.838
- Thanks for getting me out of the house.
- Hey, you're part of the family...

