00:29:45.783 --> 00:29:47.492
I wanna stay.

00:29:49.952 --> 00:29:52.787
- Bye, Bob.
- Maybe I'll see you later.

00:29:53.204 --> 00:29:55.247
- What are you doing?
- I'm having fun.

00:29:55.456 --> 00:29:57.666
What, discussing the pigeon with Bob?

00:29:58.291 --> 00:30:00.334
Hailey has so gotten under your skin.

00:30:00.542 --> 00:30:03.377
- No. This is not about Hailey.
- Oh, no?

00:30:03.586 --> 00:30:06.338
No. Maybe we needed to do this.

00:30:06.546 --> 00:30:08.339
Maybe we need to do
something dangerous.

00:30:08.547 --> 00:30:12.091
Maybe we are in a rut,
and we didn't even know it.

00:30:12.300 --> 00:30:15.552
- So you want to swing?
- I'm swinging.

00:30:17.344 --> 00:30:19.054
Heidi.

00:30:19.262 --> 00:30:22.223
You have got to finish telling me
about the Galapagos Islands.

00:30:22.431 --> 00:30:23.890
What a wild place.

00:30:25.058 --> 00:30:27.267
Forty-five minutes to midnight.

00:30:28.226 --> 00:30:31.437
If I ever get out of here,
your aunt is dead.

00:30:33.938 --> 00:30:36.481
- Hey, Ryan.
- Yeah?

00:30:36.898 --> 00:30:40.109
I have to ask you.
Why didn't you just say it?

00:30:40.609 --> 00:30:42.152
I don't know.

00:30:45.237 --> 00:30:46.988
Because I never have.

00:30:47.613 --> 00:30:48.906
But you do, right?

00:30:49.406 --> 00:30:51.741
I guess. I don't know.

00:30:52.700 --> 00:30:54.576
How do you know?

00:30:54.785 --> 00:30:57.244
I just think you know. I don't know.

00:30:59.621 --> 00:31:01.622
Yeah, I do.

00:31:04.958 --> 00:31:08.752
Why didn't you choose? I mean, you had
to like one more than the other, right?

00:31:14.088 --> 00:31:16.298
But now I don't deserve either,
because I blew it.

00:31:16.506 --> 00:31:18.216
Me too.

00:31:19.216 --> 00:31:22.093
I'm optimistic about this
Friendster thing, though.

00:31:22.302 --> 00:31:23.678
Forty-three minutes.

00:31:30.140 --> 00:31:31.391
- Hi.
- Hailey...

00:31:31.599 --> 00:31:34.810
...mad good party once again.
- Thanks for coming.

00:31:35.018 --> 00:31:36.394
Happy New Year.

00:31:38.103 --> 00:31:41.897
Where is that bitch? I can't believe
she'd even show her face in Newport.

00:31:42.106 --> 00:31:43.857
Cami, I don't know, okay?

00:31:58.950 --> 00:32:01.701
- I need help.
- Fresh oxygen.

00:32:01.910 --> 00:32:04.578
So you locked us in,
and now you want our help?

00:32:05.329 --> 00:32:07.205
- Pretty much, yes.
- No. I'm leaving.

00:32:07.413 --> 00:32:09.790
Wait, there's a girl out there
that wants to kill me.

00:32:09.998 --> 00:32:11.082
Just one?

00:32:11.291 --> 00:32:14.334
There's a girl who will kill me
if I don't get there in 39 minutes.

00:32:14.543 --> 00:32:17.420
- Okay, but please help me shut this down.
- I'm not helping you.

00:32:17.628 --> 00:32:20.130
Fine. Then she's gonna tear
this house apart.

00:32:22.631 --> 00:32:24.215
Do it for Sandy and Kirsten.

00:32:24.591 --> 00:32:26.425
Let's go. We gotta clear this party out.

00:32:26.634 --> 00:32:28.260
It's what I do best.

00:32:33.805 --> 00:32:36.682
- Good night.
- Thanks for coming.

00:32:38.850 --> 00:32:40.434
What did you do?

00:32:40.642 --> 00:32:43.853
- We shut off the power.
- Told them the cops were coming.

00:32:44.603 --> 00:32:46.438
- I gotta go.
- Go ahead. I'll clean up.

00:32:46.646 --> 00:32:48.022
- You sure?
- Yes. Go.

00:32:48.230 --> 00:32:50.190
Thirty-one minutes.
I hope I can make it.

00:32:50.398 --> 00:32:51.649
Me too.

00:33:03.949 --> 00:33:05.992
Come on, everybody. It's 11:30.

00:33:06.200 --> 00:33:07.743
We need to make our selection...

00:33:07.909 --> 00:33:11.662
...so we have someone new to ring
in the new year with.

00:33:14.914 --> 00:33:19.750
Since this is Evelyn's house,
we'll let her pick first. Evie?

00:33:26.546 --> 00:33:28.422
Way to go, Bob.

00:33:54.814 --> 00:33:55.856
Okay.

00:34:06.696 --> 00:34:09.656
I hope you have some better luck.

00:34:32.462 --> 00:34:34.630
I don't get it.

00:34:34.839 --> 00:34:38.674
Everyone else got picked.
What happened to my watch?

00:34:39.008 --> 00:34:41.176
It better be in your pants.

00:34:48.597 --> 00:34:50.432
Come on, swinger.

00:34:50.640 --> 00:34:52.016
Let's go home.

00:34:54.726 --> 00:34:56.978
Traffic is looking pretty bad
on the 73.

00:34:57.186 --> 00:35:01.772
New Year's Eve is always ugly
on the road. Luckily it's almost over.

00:35:25.454 --> 00:35:28.331
Hey. I'm gonna take off.

00:35:28.539 --> 00:35:30.582
You are? So close to midnight?

00:35:30.790 --> 00:35:34.418
Yeah, yeah. I don't wanna be here.
It's too depressing.

00:35:35.710 --> 00:35:37.836
- Happy New Year.
- Thanks.

00:35:42.423 --> 00:35:44.966
Hey. How you doing?

00:35:45.174 --> 00:35:49.427
I know it sounds stupid, but I keep
looking back at the door thinking...

00:35:49.636 --> 00:35:52.387
...maybe he'll show up...

00:35:52.971 --> 00:35:53.972
...in time.

00:35:54.514 --> 00:35:57.098
Yeah. I keep hoping to see Natalie.

00:35:57.432 --> 00:35:59.141
Sadly, I think it's just us tonight.

00:36:00.976 --> 00:36:03.144
But, hey, at least we have each other.

00:36:17.778 --> 00:36:20.446
- I think we're in the wrong house.
- I don't.

00:36:21.572 --> 00:36:22.573
What the hell happened?

00:36:22.781 --> 00:36:25.199
I don't know enough people
to cause this much damage.

00:36:25.408 --> 00:36:27.576
So how was the party?

00:36:27.993 --> 00:36:30.411
- What did you do?
- Nothing that can't be undone.

00:36:30.619 --> 00:36:33.830
A little Palmolive, some elbow grease.
Seth and I have it covered.

00:36:34.038 --> 00:36:35.664
Nobody mentioned elbow grease.

00:36:35.873 --> 00:36:38.249
Seth. Garbage. Out. Now.

00:36:41.043 --> 00:36:44.503
I look forward to waking up
to a clean house tomorrow.

00:36:46.546 --> 00:36:48.047
Good night, Sandy.

00:36:48.672 --> 00:36:50.215
I'm gonna get back to the dishes.

00:36:50.382 --> 00:36:52.175
You don't walk away from me.

00:36:52.383 --> 00:36:55.510
You're not Mom.
You can't talk to me that way.

00:36:55.718 --> 00:36:59.262
This is my house,
my upside-down couch!

00:36:59.471 --> 00:37:02.306
I will talk to you any way that I want.

00:37:08.560 --> 00:37:10.603
I should really learn to knock...

00:37:12.812 --> 00:37:16.190
...in case there's a threesome
going on in my bedroom.

00:37:18.233 --> 00:37:21.693
You can't keep living your life like this,
like you have no responsibility.

00:37:21.902 --> 00:37:23.277
Like you're still a child.

00:37:23.444 --> 00:37:25.779
What used to be cute
is now embarrassing.

00:37:25.987 --> 00:37:28.697
I'm sorry. The party got
a little out of hand.

00:37:28.864 --> 00:37:30.740
People your age,
they have finished college...

00:37:30.949 --> 00:37:33.033
...they have jobs, they're married.

00:37:33.242 --> 00:37:36.160
Look. In the morning I'll take off.

00:37:36.369 --> 00:37:39.663
I am not asking you to leave.
I just want you to grow up!

00:37:48.418 --> 00:37:51.503
It's a new year.
You can make a new start.

00:37:52.379 --> 00:37:55.506
Why? So I can grow up
to be just like you?

00:37:55.714 --> 00:37:57.841
Working for Dad,
selling McMansions...

00:37:58.049 --> 00:37:59.967
...planning charity events
with the Newpsies?

00:38:00.175 --> 00:38:02.719
Hey. I love my life...

00:38:02.927 --> 00:38:05.179
...my family, my rut.

00:38:07.388 --> 00:38:09.515
You spend so much time...

00:38:09.723 --> 00:38:14.142
...putting energy into having fun,
your whole life is dedicated to having fun.

00:38:15.518 --> 00:38:17.478
Are you even having any?

00:38:21.105 --> 00:38:24.024
- I'll help you clean up.
- I don't want your help.

00:38:26.233 --> 00:38:29.527
I'll finish in the morning.
I'm going to bed.

00:38:37.866 --> 00:38:39.533
Anna? Hey.

00:38:40.534 --> 00:38:42.869
I didn't want you to be alone
on New Year's.

00:38:44.536 --> 00:38:46.246
Actually...

00:38:47.580 --> 00:38:49.331
I didn't want to be alone
on New Year's.

00:38:50.540 --> 00:38:52.291
Well, I'm not alone.

00:38:53.042 --> 00:38:55.085
I have Captain Oats
and Carson Daly, so...

00:38:55.293 --> 00:38:59.212
Oh, wow. That's an unbeatable
combination. I'll go.

00:38:59.421 --> 00:39:03.131
Wait. Captain Oats
had too much champagne...

00:39:03.340 --> 00:39:06.509
...and Carson Daly's
kind of a ginormous tool.

00:39:07.134 --> 00:39:08.510
So I could use the company.

00:39:51.662 --> 00:39:53.204
Twenty seconds.

00:40:05.587 --> 00:40:08.339
Ten. Nine. Eight.

00:40:08.506 --> 00:40:11.341
Seven. Six. Five.

00:41:40.647 --> 00:41:42.564
You're not Seth Cohen.

00:41:42.773 --> 00:41:44.649
Who's Seth Cohen?

00:41:45.483 --> 00:41:47.901
I wasn't... I wasn't talking to you.

00:41:49.110 --> 00:41:51.028
I gotta go.

00:41:51.237 --> 00:41:53.196
Happy New Year.

00:42:00.367 --> 00:42:02.952
- I love you.
- What?

00:42:04.036 --> 00:42:05.412
I love you.

00:42:10.082 --> 00:42:11.749
Thank you.
